WEBVTT

00:09:59.476 --> 00:10:01.156
11 billion people.

00:10:01.156 --> 00:10:03.716
We don’t need to fear our neighbors.

00:10:03.716 --> 00:10:06.956
We don’t have a lack
of land or technology.

00:10:07.356 --> 00:10:09.876
We just have a lack of vision,

00:10:09.876 --> 00:10:12.716
because the answers
are hiding in plain sight.

00:10:13.396 --> 00:10:14.556
Thank you very much.

00:10:14.556 --> 00:10:21.036
(Cheers and applause)